  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Direct Assistance for Victims of Trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides short-to-medium-term assistance to victims of trafficking (VoTs) who are outside of the US, on an emergency, case-by-case basis. All assistance is to be provided in close coordination with J/TIP, NGO partners, and local IOM offices around the world (where applicable).</narrative>
  </description>
